{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/table-core"},{"type":"text","value":" library contains the core logic for TanStack Table. If you are using a non-standard framework or don't have access to a framework, you can use the core library directly via TypeScript or JavaScript."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"createtable","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Takes an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns a table."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createTable } from '@tanstack/table-core'\n\nconst table = createTable(options)","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"createtable","text":"createTable","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/table-core` library contains the core logic for TanStack Table. If you are using a non-standard framework or don't have access to a framework, you can use the core library directly via TypeScript or JavaScript.\n\n## `createTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/table-core'\n\nconst table = createTable(options)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Vanilla TS/JS\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/table-core` library contains the core logic for TanStack Table. If you are using a non-standard framework or don't have access to a framework, you can use the core library directly via TypeScript or JavaScript.\n\n## `createTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createTable } from '@tanstack/table-core'\n\nconst table = createTable(options)\n```\n"}
